    "not_evaluable_condition": "Fewer completed native sessions than lookback*candle_days (+1 prior candle where a candle pair is required), an uninitialized required native indicator value, a missing/late native bar, a non-positive or non-finite price, a zero total body on both sides (colour-balance facets), a missing green or red bar (last_green_vs_red, down_vs_up_moves), an all-zero-range window (wick_body), no monochromatic body run (run_biggest_move), or a 0/0 ratio (zero body AND zero ATR14) -> NOT_EVALUABLE (excluded, never NO). Volume facets add: a missing/negative/non-finite native volume or dollar field, all-zero window volume on both sides (dominance), a zero 50-bar median volume (dry_up_at_low), or a zero baseline mean with zero window mean (vs_own_past). Swing/segment facets add: a non-contiguous OAT scalar pairing (swing_mid_lo != swing_low_edge+1), no complete cross-zone swing in the window (both *_none outcomes answer NO; the question is still evaluable), an inverted literal ratio interval (registered hi < 1 so 1/hi > hi; retained, never reordered), or a zero decline-leg mean with zero rally-leg mean (all three segment recipes).",
